Z||000000||Spektrum-87GT||08-29-2001||07:05 PM||||i've worked with fiberglass before, and am designing a custom interior for my fiero. my question is, has anyone done this before on here? i mean started completely from scratch. My plans are to take it a lot like a kit car interior is done. basically a lot of vinyl upholstered pieces of fiberglass  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I've got ideas for the carpeting, door panels, and seats too. I'll post my progress on my website when I get started, just wanted some feedback from you all.||||reg||1
