Z||000006||MinnGreenGT||08-30-2001||12:10 PM||||Eddy (see link below) created his own dash from Fiberglass- I really like it.  Apparantly he has hooked up with someone in LasVegas NV who is producing them (or importing them) here.  I contacted them by email and was quoted $2500 (I think) for the dash upholstered and complete.  Looks cool, but a little out of my price range.<P><A HREF="http://members.tripod.lycos.nl/FIERO_2/thumbnails-1.html" TARGET=_blank>http://members.tripod.lycos.nl/FIERO_2/thumbnails-1.html</A><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngtsig3.jpg"> <BR>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett||||reg||1
Z||000007||Monkeyman||08-30-2001||01:57 PM||||MinnGreenGT--Last I heard, the "gentleman" in Vegas was no where to be seen.  I spoke with him when he first received Eddys molds and he talked about $1500 bare, but nobody's been able to reach him since.  Where did you get your info?  Is it current?  Eddy's got the nicest dash I've ever seen, but...||||reg||1
Z||000008||MinnGreenGT||08-30-2001||02:07 PM||||Monkeyman- I emailed Eddy directly, and he sent a reply to me, as well as to the guy in Vegas.  Mr. Vegas ('cause I don't remember his name) emailed me a couple of times in response. That was all about 2 months ago (I think).  I may have his email address somewhere, but I'd suggest just emailing Eddy again to see if he knows anything else!<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngtsig3.jpg"> <BR>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett||||reg||1
